return {h=6,w=1050,cr=50,hc=40,bh=70,gr="slow",eg={"no-eggs"},st={135,85,40,40,85,5},ab={{53,0},{47,0},{82,1}},genus={en="Big Eater Pokémon",es="Pokémon Comilón",pt="Pokémon Comilão"},flavor={en={[12]="It wolfs down its weight in food once a day, swallowing food whole with almost no chewing.",[13]="It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food.",[14]="In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.",[15]="It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.",[16]="It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.",[17]="In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.",[18]="In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.",[21]="In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.",[22]="In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.",[23]="It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food.",[24]="It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.",[25]="It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food.",[26]="It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.",[27]="It needs to consume its own weight in food every day. As far as flavor is concerned, it’s indifferent.",[28]="When it finds something that looks like it might be edible, it goes right ahead and swallows it whole. That’s why it gets fatter day by day.",[29]="It hides food under its long fur, but it sometimes forgets about it and causes a stinky disturbance.",[30]="Anything that looks edible, Munchlax will go on and swallow whole. Its stomach is tough enough to handle it even if the food has gone rotten.",[33]="Stuffing itself with vast amounts of food is its only concern. Whether the food is rotten or fresh, yummy or tasteless, it does not care.",[34]="It stores food beneath its fur. It might share just one bite, but only if it really trusts you.",[39]="Its robust stomach allows it to nonchalantly devour even rotted matter. It pays frequent visits to villages, seeking out food scraps intended for compost."},es={[23]="Esconde comida bajo el largo pelo de su cuerpo, pero más tarde lo olvida.",[24]="En el interior de su pelaje revuelto esconde la comida que luego engullirá de una vez.",[25]="Esconde comida bajo el largo pelo de su cuerpo, pero más tarde lo olvida.",[26]="En el interior de su pelaje revuelto esconde la comida que luego engullirá de una vez.",[27]="Necesita ingerir cada día el equivalente a su peso corporal en comida. Le importa poco el sabor que pueda tener.",[28]="En cuanto encuentra algo comestible, lo recoge y lo engulle de un bocado, por lo que cada día está más y más gordo.",[29]="Aprovecha su largo pelaje para ocultar comida, pero se le suele olvidar y acaba generando un olor a putrefacción muy molesto para los demás.",[30]="En cuanto encuentra algo comestible, lo recoge y lo engulle de un bocado. Su robusto estómago le permite ingerir alimentos podridos sin inmutarse.",[33]="Atiborrarse de comida es su fijación. Como no le hace ascos a nada, puede ingerir alimentos podridos sin inmutarse.",[34]="Guarda alimentos bajo el pelaje. Compartirá un pequeño bocado de vez en cuando con quien logre ganarse su confianza."},pt="Seu estômago resistente permite que devore com tranquilidade até matéria podre. Visita vilarejos com frequência, procurando restos de comida destinados à compostagem."},evo={{s=446},{s=143,from=446,c={{t="level-up",happy=160}}}},moves={[8]={1,118,1,316,1,33,4,111,9,133,12,122,17,278,20,103,25,254,28,256,33,34,36,374,41,205,44,363,49,387},[9]={1,118,1,316,1,33,4,111,9,13